<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Viking Office downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Viking Office downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said the firm lowered its recommendation on Viking Office Products Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment on the move.</p>
<p>-- Shares were off five points to 15 in morning Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
